;    8: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=ちゅうちょ, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    9: TDecorate(count=505, unk2=8388863, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   10: TDecorate(count=20, unk2=5265653, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   11: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=にら, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   12: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=だま, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   13: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=ふぬ, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   14: TDecorate(count=19, unk2=16776960, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   15: TDecorate(count=409, unk2=6413008, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   16: TDecorate(count=4, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=はいかい, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   17: TDecorate(count=12, unk2=13464750, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   18: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=あお, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   19: TDecorate(count=3, unk2=16777215, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   20: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=もんぜつ, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
; Display conditions:
;    0: TWdCondition(count=8114, target=)
; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=7299, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\アポカリプティック.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\蔵2階.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>'The Fierce Sound' rang out.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
An eerie, loud sound, unlike any I had ever heard before.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Once I learn the truth... <STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> moves.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If <STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> moves, the corpses move.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And if the corpses move...<PG>
At last I understand the truth of the curse-killings.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\Dark_Energy.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{PLAYMOVIE "豊岳桜.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "0" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The curse-killings were <STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> controlling corpses to add to the dead.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If the dead increase, the seedbeds increase.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If the seedbeds increase, the cherry trees that have dwindled can be multiplied, and growth and reproduction spurred.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The curse-killings―the dead taking the living to the next world―
{PAUSE ""}
were the shinigami carrying off the living, exactly as the word says.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> has survived by never showing itself, single-mindedly disguising itself as cherry trees, so I, who have come to know about <STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>, will probably be this year's target.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Because anyone who sees through that disguise is a threat, and has to be disposed of in secret.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Now that 'the Fierce Sound' has rung out, the corpses will come for me...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Will they look as hideous as rotted-away zombies, or will they have lost even the shape of a human?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n1000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\蔵2階.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "T" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{MESON "500"}
Hurry... I have to hurry and leave a memo!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And I mustn't look at what I'm writing!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My five senses are an open book to <STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>―!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, but if it reads my brain, then whatever I do is already too late...!<PG>
Calm down...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's a gamble, but I'm betting that all <STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> can hijack is the five senses, and that it can't read thoughts.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Because the eerie sound didn't ring until I'd finished reading this book.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If it could tell even what I was thinking, the eerie sound should have rung the moment I found this book.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\携帯茅萱切.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "C" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\携帯茅萱入.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "200" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
I took out my phone and switched it to voice-recording mode.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This way, if anything happens to me, the information will be left on the phone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And now I'll quickly put what I've just learned into a memo.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My handwriting is bad to begin with; written without looking, who knows what hieroglyphs will come out―but it's still better than leaving nothing.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\writing_in_a_pen.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\茅萱手紙.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">If you are reading this, it means I have gone missing, I suppose.</STYLE>
{CHGVOL "SE" "0" "100" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "100" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">You may think this reads like the opening of a suspense drama, but that is exactly the situation I am in right now.</STYLE>
{CHGVOL "SE" "0" "100" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "100" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">I am being watched.</STYLE>
{CHGVOL "SE" "0" "100" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "100" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">From far away, and from close by.</STYLE>
{CHGVOL "SE" "0" "100" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "100" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">No―I think I was being watched even back when I was in Tokyo.</STYLE>
{CHGVOL "SE" "0" "100" "PASS"}
<PG>
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "100" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">There is a reason I am going to the trouble of leaving this memo.</STYLE>
{CHGVOL "SE" "0" "100" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "100" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="3">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> spoke of a 'someone,' and I have finally reached its true identity.</STYLE>
{CHGVOL "SE" "0" "100" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "100" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">It seems '</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">she</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">' can see everything through my five senses.</STYLE>
{CHGVOL "SE" "0" "100" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "100" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">But it seems '</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">she</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">' cannot read my thoughts.</STYLE>
{CHGVOL "SE" "0" "100" "PASS"}
<PG>
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "100" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">Right now I am writing this memo with my eyes turned the other way.</STYLE>
{CHGVOL "SE" "0" "100" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "100" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">This way, '</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">she</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">' cannot see this memo through me.</STYLE>
{CHGVOL "SE" "0" "100" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "100" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">I expect it is hard to read, but please forgive that.</STYLE>
{CHGVOL "SE" "0" "100" "PASS"}
<PG>
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "100" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="3">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> spoke of a 'someone,' and its name is '</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.'</STYLE>
{CHGVOL "SE" "0" "100" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "100" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">It is a giant organism that has been rooted in this land of Arata for tens of thousands of years.</STYLE>
{CHGVOL "SE" "0" "100" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "100" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="4">She</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> is apparently classified as a fungus called the honey fungus, and she grows by planting her spores in other living things.</STYLE>
{CHGVOL "SE" "0" "100" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "100" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">In other words, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> is a parasite.</STYLE>
{CHGVOL "SE" "0" "100" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "100" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">What looks like cherry trees is, in fact, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">her</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> fruiting body.</STYLE>
{CHGVOL "SE" "0" "100" "PASS"}
<PG>
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "100" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">Precognition, the curse-killings, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s death, my green eyes.</STYLE>
{CHGVOL "SE" "0" "100" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "100" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">All of these are nothing more than acts of reproduction, carried out so that </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> can survive.</STYLE>
{CHGVOL "SE" "0" "100" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "100" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">What a wild organism does to reproduce simply looks, to us humans, like curses and paranormal phenomena. That is all it is.</STYLE>
{CHGVOL "SE" "0" "100" "PASS"}
<PG>
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "100" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">Fortunately, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">she</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> has no intelligence.</STYLE>
{CHGVOL "SE" "0" "100" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "100" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">She has no intelligence, yet she seems to have acquired a way of misleading us by using corpses.</STYLE>
{CHGVOL "SE" "0" "100" "PASS"}
<PG>
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "100" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">Just in case, I have been recording what happens here on my phone the whole time.</STYLE>
{CHGVOL "SE" "0" "100" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "100" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">Whoever finds this letter, please listen to the recording on the phone.</STYLE>
{CHGVOL "SE" "0" "100" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "100" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">I have not set a password or a lock.</STYLE>
{CHGVOL "SE" "0" "100" "PASS"}
<PG>
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
―I couldn't check the letters, but that is what I meant to write.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Ah, no! The part about intelligence is wrong!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's not that she has none―she takes the intelligence she lacks from the dead.<PG>
But even if I wanted to rewrite it, I'm not even allowed to look at it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Besides, the corpses are coming for me, so there's no time left either.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's wrong information, but all I can do is bet on the chance that <STYLE ID="6">Goto-chan</STYLE> and the others will get the right information.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\蔵本乱雑.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
All that's left is to hide this in the pile of books, where it will never come into my sight.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I don't know how precise the sense-theft is, but if it can guess what I wrote from my hand movements alone, I'm done for.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Either way, I've done everything I can.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Now I just have to see nothing and hear nothing!<PG>
Wait! Something important is missing!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There has to be a way to cure this constitution of mine!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At the very least, I have to find that text...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If it's a constitution caused by Droga, wouldn't it be written in the text that records how to make Droga...!?<PG>
............ 
{PAUSE ""}
............ 
{PAUSE ""}
............ 
{PAUSE ""}
Found it!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\蔵本.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The Droga Refining Method.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\紙ペラ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
Where...? Where is it...!?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\紙ペラ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
I turned page after page, skimming the classical Japanese, but reading it quickly was hard, as you'd expect.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\紙ペラ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
Even what I'm looking into right now is an open book to <STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\紙ペラ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
If I dawdle, there's no telling what will happen.<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\紙ペラ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
―!! This is it!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
On the last page, a note added by Kikyo-san in Shiyo 735.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Administering falsificaso can suppress the signs of the curse-killing.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Falsificaso...?<PG>
Right now, it should be being made under the secret base.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
We're due to use falsificaso tomorrow, so it has to be there!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I have to hurry and cure this constitution...!<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "500" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\手で歩く.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
............!?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Footsteps...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Not the sound of shoes, but of bare feet walking.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Someone had come into the storehouse...!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\蔵2階.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "T" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"Who's there!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ナイフを構える.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
I let out a call bristling with hostility and drew one of the two knives I carry.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Is it a human, or a corpse?<PG>
{PLAYSND "環境音\心臓の鼓動.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\蔵2階赤.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Surely I can at least tell a living person from a buried corpse.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
