That's it! <STYLE ID="15">Uncle</STYLE> died with his neck pierced by the fence, and <STYLE ID="9">Mom</STYLE> had her head cut off!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And yet neither of them had any wound at all on the neck.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In other words, they're telling me that however much I wound them, I can't do them any damage.<PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"And besides, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\サクラ白装束.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\残像.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n3\r\n1100\r\n500\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\n人物1\r\n11\r\n0\r\n500\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n123\r\n人物3\r\n11\r\n0\r\n200\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n3\r\n1100\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\n人物1\r\n11\r\n0\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n123\r\n人物3\r\n11\r\n0\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{DELETECG "人物1,人物3" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">Mom</STYLE>'s body swayed and tilted.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The instant I thought so―
{PAUSE ""}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "20" "100" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\tackle1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
a violent shock tore through my solar plexus.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Against my will, my legs buckled limply at the joints, and my head hit the ground.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\地下に突然できたトンネル.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\サクラ白装束.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"This body, ruled by </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">the Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">, no longer has human limits. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">For us, the effect of using Droga simply goes on."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\栄一郎白装束.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="15">"Well, that's how it is. We can't die, and we're far stronger than you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Chigaya-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="15">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="15">Better not defy us, hm?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="15">　Besides―look."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1,000,人物2" "20" "100" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\菌糸動き.lcm" "REPEAT" "#1" "C" "540" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n111\r\n4\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\bakibaki.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\茅萱手縛られる.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{QUAKE "人物1" "QUAKE" "1" "5" "5" "0" "30"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n111\r\n4\r\n0\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
On <STYLE ID="15">Uncle</STYLE>'s 'look,' something wound around my arms and legs.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Snake-like things wriggled up out of the ground and bound my limbs.<PG>
{STOPSND "VOICE" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="7">"Wh-what is this...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"The Arata settlement is </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">the Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">'s territory. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">Stretching out hyphae at will and tying you up is nothing at all."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="15">"If she felt like it, she could use every corpse there is and sink this place in a sea of cherry trees. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="15">Give it up now. We won't treat you badly."</STYLE><PG>
Like a spider in a specimen box, my four limbs were pinned flat.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I felt anger at their <STYLE ID="18" RUBY="あお">goading</STYLE> words, but even more than that, I felt despair.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Monsters like these... there's no way I can take them on...!<PG>
<STYLE ID="19">Won't </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Mom</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="15">Uncle</STYLE>... ever come back to their senses?<PG>
No...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> has no intelligence, so it's only getting intelligence by using the brains of the dead.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> is confusing me through the intelligence of these two.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">Mom</STYLE> wouldn't really want anything like this, and neither would <STYLE ID="15">Uncle</STYLE>...!<PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">! </STYLE><STYLE ID="15">Uncle</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">! You don't really want to do this, do you!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">　Stop it!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{QUAKESTOP "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\地下に突然できたトンネル.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\サクラ白装束.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">, what are you saying? </STYLE><STYLE ID="15">Eiichiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> and I are already dead. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">Surely you understand that this self belongs to </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">the Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\栄一郎白装束.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="15">"The way we talk and think comes from the original owners of these bodies, but what rules the mind now is </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">the Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="15">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="15">The original owners' minds died more than 10 years ago."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"How could you...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They didn't even seem to care about hiding that their wills had been taken over completely.<PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"That's right. So, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">our looks, our ways of thinking, our memories are the same as the original owners', but what's inside is someone else."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Then... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">then kill me here!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">　You'll drive me mad and make me kill everyone, or turn me into a cherry tree once I'm no more use, right!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">　Hurry up and kill me!"</STYLE><PG>
If I became one of them, even in death I'd be something that hurts everyone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In that case, I'd rather have my body destroyed beyond any repair and die harmless.<PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"It's all right, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">. Soon you won't care about such things at all."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Don't use </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">'s voice! Don't you imitate </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I tightened the grip of my right hand, which was barely holding on to the knife.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I began a useless struggle to shake off the hyphae binding my arms and legs.
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE\ナイフ投げる.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I swung the knife around wildly, putting up a last resistance.
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE\ナイフ投げる.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<PG>
<STYLE ID="15">"Wait, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Chigaya-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="15">, no, not that!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">, stop it! Don't move!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE\ナイフ投げる.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
You hate me swinging a knife around that much!?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE\ナイフ投げる.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
Then at least I'll show you one last desperate struggle!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "500" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE" "500" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\エデン\ナイフ回転.lcm" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAITPLAY "アイテム1" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
And then the knife I was swinging slipped right out of my hand and spun round and round in the air.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It fell straight down and slashed my arm.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\茅萱手縛られる血.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"Gh...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The well-honed knife left a cut about a centimeter deep in my arm.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It wasn't fatal, but it was a pretty deep cut.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Blood began to flow from my arm at once.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And then―<PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"Ugh! Gah-gah-gah-gah...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="15">"Aaaaah...!!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Slippery_Slope.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\地下に突然できたトンネル.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\サクラ頭抱える白装束.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\栄一郎白装束頭抱える.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The two of them clutched their heads and began to writhe.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At the same time, the hyphae binding me thrashed about as if they had panicked.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Without my having to move at all, my arms and legs were free again.<PG>
But I couldn't make sense of the sight before me, and forgot even to stand up.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For some reason, the two of them―
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> was suffering...?<PG>
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n4\r\n540\r\n200\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
<STYLE ID="9">"Ngh-gh-gh-gh...!!"</STYLE>
{WAITPLAY "789" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\down1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\n人物2\r\n4\r\n540\r\n200\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
<STYLE ID="15">"Aaaah...!!"</STYLE>
{WAITPLAY "789" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\down1.ogg" "VOICE2" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With a last <STYLE ID="20" RUBY="もんぜつ">groan of agony</STYLE>, the two of them collapsed on the spot.
